    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka man otum, jo Icrael ducu ma onoŋo gitye gucito i gaŋi ducu ma i Juda gucako ŋido wir jogi woko i dul matitino, gutoŋo yadi ducu ma yam gicomo pi woro jok ma dako ma gilwoŋo Acera, ki waŋ jogi ma i wi godi kacel ki keno tyer ducu ma gunoŋo i Juda, Benjamin, Epraim ki Manace, nio ka gubologi woko ducu. Lacen lwak jo Icrael ducu gucako dok i gaŋigi, kun dano acel acel odok i pacone kikome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia ocako keto ajwagi ki Lulevi i dul ticgi, oketogi i dul ki dul, ŋat acel acel macalo ticce tye, ma gin ajwagi ki Lulevi ticgi obedo me tyero gitum awaŋa ki gityer lakwecwiny, kun gitiyo bene i dog gaŋ mapatpat me ot pa Rwot pi miyo pwoc ki pak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Wel 28.1–29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jami ma kabaka okwanyo me amiya ki i kom jamine kikome obedo pi gitum awaŋa-gu: gitum awaŋa me odiko ki me otyeno, ki gitum awaŋa pi cabit-gu, por dwe, ki pi nino madito ma giciko, ma gilubo kit macalo gicoyo i cik pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 18.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En bene ociko lwak ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem ni gumi dul ma giciko me amiya bot ajwagi ki Lulevi, wek gumi kwogi me tiyo ticgi kun gilubo cik pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cutcut ma cik man oket oromo i lobo ducu, ci jo Icrael gucako miyo jami mapol ata, bel me wi mwaka, kono yino, moo, moo kic ki kit jami mukene ducu ma guceko i pottigi; dok gukelo acel me apar me jami acel acel madwoŋ makato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak jo Icrael ki jo Juda ma gibedo i gaŋi me Juda bene gukelo acel me apar me dyaŋi ki romi, ki jami mukene ma gityeko dyerogi bot Rwot Lubaŋagi, ci gubakogi lipim i odur mapol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucako pano jami magi i odur ki odur i dwe me adek, ci gutyeko paijogi i dwe me abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Kejekia ki rwodi gubino guneno odur me jami ma gipaŋo, ci gupwoyo Rwot kacel ki lwakke jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia openyo ajwagi ki Lulevi pi odur magi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Ajaria ajwaka madit, ma en dano me ot pa Jadok, odokke iye ni, “Nia ma lwak gucako kelo jami me motgi i ot pa Rwot pe tye gin mo ma orem; wabedo ka camo cam muromo dok mudoŋŋe obedo pol ata; pien Rwot omiyo gum ki jone, en aye meno mumiyo watye ki lwak cam man ducu mudoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia dok ocikogi ni guyub kicika mogo i ot-pa Rwot; ci cut giyubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak gukelo gityer me motgi, acel me apar ki jami ma gidyero, ducu gukelo ki cwinygi ducu. Rwot madit ma loyo wigi obedo Konania ma en Lalevi, ki ominne Cimei obedo ŋat ma lube, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun giketo Jekiel, Ajajia, Nakat, Acael, Jerimot, Jojabad, Eliel, Icmakia, Makat, ki Benaya me bedo lunen-tic pi konyo Konania ki ominne Cimei. Jo magi kabaka Kejekia ki Ajaria ma en ladit ma loyo tic i ot pa Lubaŋa en aye guyerogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kore ma wod pa Imla ma Lalevi giketo en lagwok dog gaŋ ma yo tuŋ wokceŋ; en ticce obedo me loyo gityer ma ic pwoyo bot Lubaŋa, me poko tyer ma gimiyo bot Rwot ki gityer maleŋ makato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eden, Miniamin, Yecwa, Cemaya, Amaria ki Cekania aye gubedo ka konyo en ki gen madit i gaŋi pa ajwagi, pi poko dul jami bot utmegigi, jo muteggi ki-jo matino ducu ma romrom kun lubo dul ticgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pe lu bo kit ma gicoyogi i buk me tekwaro. Gipoko bot co ma ditogi romo pyeradek dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma gidonyo i ot pa Rwot kit macalo tic me nino acel acel tye kwede, ma gitiyo tic ma lubo dog ticgi ki dul ticgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicoyo ajwagi kun lubo dog odi pa kwarogi; ento Lulevi cakke i kom dano ma ditte mwaka pyeraryo dok kwede malo olu bo dog tic megi ki dul ticgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicoyo ajwagi kacel ki jo ducu ma tye botgi, mongi, awobe, ki anyiragi, ki lwakgi ducu; pien onoŋo gubedo lugen kun gigwokke kengi pi bedo maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ pi likwayo pa Aron, ajwagi ma onoŋo gibedo i lobo ma orumo gaŋigi, giyero nyiŋ co mogo ki i gaŋigi acel acel bene me poko dul jami mogo bot laco acel acel ma i kin ajwagi, ki bot dano acel acel ma i kin Lulevi ma gityeko coyo eno",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia otiyo ticce kit meno oromo i lobo Juda ducu; en obedo ka tiyo gin maber, ma nen atir ki ma nyuto gen i nyim Rwot Lubaŋane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit tic acel acel ma en obedo ka tiyone ma mako tic i ot pa Lubaŋa ma lubo cik ki gin ma giciko ducu, otiyo ki cwinye ducu, dok obedo ka yenyo Lubaŋane; ticce owoto maber twatwal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
